### Add a completed activity
POST http://localhost:8080/activity/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Description": "Morning standup meeting",
  "Project": "TEAM",
  "StartTime": "2026-01-31T09:00:00Z",
  "EndTime": "2026-01-31T09:30:00Z"
}

### Add another completed activity
POST http://localhost:8080/activity/add
