### Add activity with attributes
POST http://localhost:8080/activity/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Description": "Client meeting",
  "Project": "CONSULTING",
  "StartTime": "2026-01-31T14:00:00Z",
  "EndTime": "2026-01-31T15:30:00Z",
  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Key": "billable",
      "Value": "true"
    },
    {
      "Key": "client",
      "Value": "widget-inc"
    },
    {
      "Key": "rate",
      "Value": "150"
    }
  ]
}
